desc:
'High-degree regulatory hubs sit at higher kNN centrality' is called the 'strongest new result', yet it rests on:
- z = 1.31 / 2.34 / 2.36 from 100 label permutations;
- one layer (L6) and one k (12);
- no correction across domains or across the batch of exploratory hypotheses;
- no control for expression or token frequency, which correlates with both TRRUST degree (literature bias) and graph cent
